Source: shellos-desktop
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sahil Patki <161210761+sahil-mpatki@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: shellos-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 shellos-tuning, shellos-boot, shellos-branding, shellos-kernel-tools, linux-shellos,
# At least one desktop; the installer adds the ones you pick
 shellos-de-cosmic | shellos-de-pantheon | shellos-de-gnome | shellos-de-kde
  | shellos-de-hyprland | shellos-de-i3 | shellos-de-dwm | shellos-de-bspwm,
# Shared login screen for every desktop (lists Wayland and X11 sessions)
 cosmic-greeter,
 xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, gnome-keyring, libpam-gnome-keyring, switcheroo-control, adw-gtk3,
# CPU scheduler userspace
 scx-scheds,
# Intel Alder/Raptor Lake: microcode, GPU, Wi-Fi, audio DSP, thermals
 intel-microcode, firmware-intel-graphics, firmware-iwlwifi, firmware-sof-signed,
 intel-media-va-driver-non-free, mesa-vulkan-drivers, thermald,
# Session plumbing
 pipewire-audio, wireplumber, playerctl, network-manager, bluez,
 power-profiles-daemon, fwupd, xdg-user-dirs, plymouth, plymouth-label, sudo,
# Your picks: zsh, Alacritty, Firefox (Mozilla repo), Flatpak, Distrobox
 zsh, zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, starship, alacritty,
 firefox, flatpak, distrobox, podman,
# Snapshots UI
 snapper, btrfs-assistant,
# Fonts
 fonts-jetbrains-mono, fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Description: ShellOS base desktop system
 Pulls in the ShellOS kernel, tuning and boot integration, the shared login
 screen, Intel hybrid-CPU firmware and drivers, the sched_ext LAVD
 scheduler, and the default user environment (zsh + starship, Alacritty,
 Firefox, Flatpak with Flathub, Distrobox). The desktops themselves are the
 shellos-de-* packages.

Package: shellos-de-cosmic
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop,
 cosmic-session, cosmic-files, cosmic-settings, cosmic-store, cosmic-edit,
 cosmic-player, xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic, xwayland
Description: ShellOS desktop: COSMIC
 System76's COSMIC desktop, rebuilt for Debian trixie by ShellOS.

Package: shellos-de-pantheon
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop,
 gala, io.elementary.wingpanel, io.elementary.dock, io.elementary.applications-menu,
 io.elementary.quick-settings, io.elementary.notifications, io.elementary.settings-daemon,
 io.elementary.portals, pantheon-agent-polkit, pantheon-xsession-settings,
 elementary-default-settings, io.elementary.stylesheet, elementary-icon-theme,
 io.elementary.sound-theme, elementary-wallpapers, io.elementary.shortcut-overlay,
 io.elementary.bluetooth-daemon,
 io.elementary.panel.bluetooth, io.elementary.panel.datetime, io.elementary.panel.keyboard,
 io.elementary.panel.network, io.elementary.panel.nightlight,
 io.elementary.panel.notifications, io.elementary.panel.power, io.elementary.panel.sound,
 io.elementary.settings, io.elementary.settings.system, io.elementary.settings.applications,
 io.elementary.settings.bluetooth, io.elementary.settings.datetime,
 io.elementary.settings.desktop, io.elementary.settings.display,
 io.elementary.settings.keyboard, io.elementary.settings.locale,
 io.elementary.settings.mouse-touchpad, io.elementary.settings.network,
 io.elementary.settings.notifications, io.elementary.settings.power,
 io.elementary.settings.printers, io.elementary.settings.security-privacy,
 io.elementary.settings.sharing, io.elementary.settings.sound,
 io.elementary.settings.useraccounts, io.elementary.settings.wacom,
 pantheon-files, io.elementary.terminal, io.elementary.code,
 fonts-inter, fonts-open-sans, xserver-xorg, xinit
Provides: pantheon-shell
Description: ShellOS desktop: Pantheon
 elementary OS's Pantheon desktop (Gala, Wingpanel, Dock, System Settings,
 Files, Terminal and Code), built for Debian trixie by ShellOS.

Package: shellos-de-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop, gnome-core
Description: ShellOS desktop: GNOME
 Debian's core GNOME desktop. ShellOS keeps its shared login screen; GNOME's
 own (GDM) is installed but not used.

Package: shellos-de-kde
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop, kde-plasma-desktop
Description: ShellOS desktop: KDE Plasma
 Debian's core KDE Plasma desktop. ShellOS keeps its shared login screen;
 Plasma's own (SDDM) is installed but not used.

Package: shellos-wm-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop,
 xserver-xorg, xinit, x11-xserver-utils, rofi, picom, dunst, feh, i3lock, xss-lock,
 maim, xclip, lxpolkit, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol, brightnessctl, playerctl,
 fonts-font-awesome
Description: shared pieces of the ShellOS X11 window managers
 Launcher, notification, compositor and lock-screen setup in the ShellOS
 colours, used by the i3, bspwm and dwm desktops.

Package: shellos-de-hyprland
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-desktop,
 hyprland (>= 0.55), hypridle, hyprlock, hyprpolkitagent, xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland,
 waybar, fuzzel, mako-notifier, swaybg, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard,
 network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol, brightnessctl, playerctl, fonts-font-awesome,
 qt6-wayland
Description: ShellOS desktop: Hyprland
 The Hyprland tiling Wayland compositor (from trixie-backports) with the
 ShellOS configuration: Waybar, fuzzel launcher, mako notifications,
 hyprlock and hypridle, and the shared ShellOS keybindings.

Package: shellos-de-i3
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-wm-common, i3-wm, i3status
Description: ShellOS desktop: i3
 The i3 tiling window manager with the ShellOS configuration: i3bar,
 rofi launcher, dunst notifications, picom, and the shared ShellOS
 keybindings.

Package: shellos-de-bspwm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-wm-common, bspwm, sxhkd, polybar
Description: ShellOS desktop: bspwm
 The bspwm tiling window manager with the ShellOS configuration: sxhkd keys,
 polybar, rofi launcher, dunst notifications, picom, and the shared ShellOS
 keybindings.

Package: shellos-de-dwm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, shellos-wm-common, shellos-dwm
Description: ShellOS desktop: dwm
 suckless dwm built with the ShellOS configuration, with a status line,
 rofi launcher, dunst notifications, picom, and the shared ShellOS
 keybindings.
